# =============================================================================
# PiShock Discord Activity - Environment Variables Configuration
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BUILD-TIME VARIABLES (Safe for Frontend)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These are embedded in the frontend bundle during build
# Only use VITE_ prefix for PUBLIC, NON-SENSITIVE data

# Discord Application ID (Public - Safe to expose)
VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=your_discord_client_id_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUNTIME SECRETS (Backend Only - NEVER use VITE_ prefix!)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These must be set as ENCRYPTED SECRETS in Cloudflare Workers
# DO NOT put sensitive values in .env files that are committed to git
#
# Set via Wrangler CLI:
#   npx wrangler secret put DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
#   npx wrangler secret put DISCORD_CLIENT_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
#
# Or set via Cloudflare Dashboard:
#   Workers & Pages → Your Worker → Settings → Variables → Add Variable (Type: Secret)

# Discord Bot Token (REQUIRED - SENSITIVE)
# DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here

# Discord Application ID (REQUIRED - SENSITIVE)
# DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=your_discord_application_id_here

# Discord OAuth2 Client Secret (REQUIRED - SENSITIVE)
# DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=your_discord_client_secret_here

# Discord Client Secret for Frontend OAuth (REQUIRED - SENSITIVE)
# VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=your_discord_client_secret_here

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ⚠️  CRITICAL SECURITY WARNINGS ⚠️
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 
# ❌ NEVER use VITE_ prefix for sensitive data like:
#    - API keys, tokens, secrets
#    - Bot tokens
#    - OAuth client secrets
#    - Database credentials
#    - Any private user data
# 
# ✅ Only use VITE_ prefix for PUBLIC data like:
#    - Public application IDs
#    - Public API endpoints
#    - Feature flags
#    - Public configuration
# 
# 📝 VITE_ variables are:
#    - Embedded directly into the frontend JavaScript bundle
#    - Visible in browser DevTools and source code
#    - Accessible to anyone who loads your application
#    - NOT suitable for any sensitive information
# 
# 🔒 Sensitive data should be:
#    - Set as Cloudflare Workers Secrets (encrypted)
#    - Only accessible in backend/worker runtime
#    - Never sent to the frontend
#    - Stored in user configuration (encrypted in KV)
# 
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEPLOYMENT NOTES
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 
# For local development:
#   1. Copy this file to .env
#   2. Fill in VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID only
#   3. Run: npm run dev
# 
# For production deployment:
#   1. Set VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID in .env for build
#   2. Set all SECRETS via Wrangler CLI or Dashboard
#   3. Run: npm run build
#   4. Run: npm run workers:deploy
# 
# Quick deployment with environment:
#   export DISCORD_CLIENT_ID="your_id_here"
#   npm run deploy:auto
# 
# =============================================================================